placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"cover_url":null,"edition_id":987247052,"bound_title":"Bandieten & broodmessen","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789020558760","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p450017176","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-048","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":987346010}'::jsonb as exact union all select 'catalog_work_descriptions:23' as ref,(select to_jsonb(t) from public.catalog_work_descriptions t where t.work_id=987147052 and t.language='nl')='{"text":"Theo Parish vertelt in deze getekende memoires over het zoeken naar een manier om zich thuis te voelen in het eigen lichaam en leven. Ervaringen op school, kapsels en alledaagse verwachtingen maken zichtbaar hoeveel onuitgesproken regels aan gender zijn verbonden. Stripscènes worden afgewisseld met dagboekachtige passages. De ontdekking van het woord non-binair biedt een nieuw aanknopingspunt om eerdere gevoelens te begrijpen. Het boek volgt die persoonlijke zoektocht zonder te suggereren dat iedereen op dezelfde manier of in hetzelfde tempo antwoorden moet vinden.","work_id":987147052,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work6182 Homebody / Theo Parish; exact Dutch Homebody ISBN 9789000388356 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-030.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p440406560"],"reference":"work:6182","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-030.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL37585310W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p4404065