robeert Wilfried Wils als hulpagent te overleven en tegelijk dichter te worden. In zijn omgeving staan mensen tegenover elkaar die hem ieder beïnvloeden. Lode neemt risico''s om Joden te helpen, terwijl Wilfrieds artistieke mentor hun vervolging juist ondersteunt. De liefde van Yvette maakt de verhoudingen nog persoonlijker. Jaren later vertelt Wilfried een nakomeling hoe hij tussen die werelden laveerde. De roman onderzoekt de manier waarop hij zijn keuzes onder geweld en wantrouwen probeert te verklaren.","work_id":987147003,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work1628 Wil / Jeroen Olyslaegers; exact Dutch Wil ISBN 9789023498438 paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-030.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p410610828","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p401535495"],"reference":"work:1628","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-030.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL25073337W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p410610828","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p401535495"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789023498438","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_source_failure_no_retry","coverId":11964193,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.996Z","editionKey":"/books/OL33339138M","limit